OL,3,GNEWSAYouth football behaviour warning
OL,4,Aafter 72 red cards and alleged assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FA youth football league has issued a
OL,7,Fwarning about bad behaviour after 72
OL,8,Fred cards were handed out and a team
OL,9,Fofficial was assaulted during the first
OL,10,Fweek of the new season.
OL,12,FOfficials from the Central Scotland
OL,13,FFootball Association said they have
OL,14,Freceived reports of violence,
OL,15,Fthreatening behaviour, discriminatory
OL,16,Flanguage and matches being abandoned.
OL,18,FOne of the incidents happened during a
OL,19,Ffootball festival for five and
OL,20,Fsix-year-olds, where a team official is
OL,21,Falleged to have headbutted another team
OL,22,Fofficial.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
